    <p><%= link_to 'Administrator login', new_admin_user_session_path %>: <code>admin@handforged.invalid</code> / <code>HandForgedDemo!</code></p>
    <p>Demo JSON key: <code>hand-forged-demo</code>. <%= link_to 'Sample JSON', index_json_path(api_key: 'hand-forged-demo', include_shelters: true) %>.</p>
    <p><%= link_to 'Local demo mail inbox', hand_forged_mail_path %>. Reset messages stay in this browser session.</p>
  </details>
</aside>
